   "text": "is obvious. Outline the first chapter this week, then write 300 words a day. Same with getting fit."
  },
  {
   "s": 22.66,
   "e": 27.18,
   "text": "Don't start with a six-day gym program. Walk 30 minutes after dinner three days this week."
  },
  {
